XHTTP server: Allow Mux.Cool and add an idle KeepAlive

The mux-ka fork at 21c66ef1 against upstream with patches/xhttp-flow applied:
the XHTTP inbound takes Mux.Cool TCP sessions, and the server pokes an idle
downlink with a Mux.Cool KeepAlive frame ("muxKeepAliveSecs",
"muxKeepAliveBytes" in the XHTTP "extra").
---
